1,Esperanto - Wikipedia,https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Esperanto,"Esperanto (/ ˌɛs.pə.ˈrɑːn.toʊ, -.ˈræn.toʊ /; Esperanto: [espeˈranto]) [6][7] is the world's most widely spoken constructed auxiliary language. Created by L. L. Zamenhof in 1887 as ""the International Language"" (la Lingvo Internacia), it is intended to be a universal second language for international communication. He described the language in Dr. Esperanto's International Language ...",Esperanto,Constructed language
